        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The process will apply to new and changed MA1 through MA5 or equivalent jobs/work in the Management Pay Plan or successor titles, TA and Occupational Non-represented employees or equivalent jobs/work in the Management Pay Plan or their respective successor titles. New or changed jobs include the assignment of work moved in whole or in part from the bargaining unit",
